---
// Install / CTA band: bordered panel, inner glow, two-command terminal.
---
<section id="install" style="padding:8px 0 110px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="panel reveal" style="padding:64px 40px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden">
      <div class="glow" style="top:-200px;opacity:.5"></div>
      <h2 style="position:relative;font-size:clamp(2rem,3.8vw,3rem);max-width:18ch">Give your agents a clear path forward.</h2>
      <p style="position:relative;margin-top:18px;color:var(--subtle);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:48ch">
        Source-first and Bun-native. Clone, install, and launch the local guidance dashboard in two commands.
      </p>
      <div class="term mono" style="position:relative;margin-top:34px;width:100%;max-width:440px;text-align:left">
        <div class="term-bar"><span class="term-dot"></span><span class="term-dot"></span><span class="term-dot"></span></div>
        <div class="term-body" style="font-size:13.5px">
          <div><span class="c-green">$</span> <span class="c-fg">bun install</span></div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px"><span class="c-green">$</span> <span class="c-fg">bun run zenith</span></div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--faint)"># local guidance dashboard launches</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="position:relative;margin-top:30px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get started</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#guidance">See how guidance works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
